<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE - Hanjin Eng H1 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hanjin Eng H1 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>	 (In billions of won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			 loss  565    vs gain  61</p>
<p>    Net				 loss    9.58 vs gain   1.02</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	     loss    9.58 vs gain   1.02</p>
<p>    Turnover				  485.97 vs	433.03</p>
<p>Note - South Korea's Hanjin Engineering and Construction Co Ltd, an affiliate of Hanjin Group, is a construction company. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
